  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Maya Programme III Phase (2019-2022)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The third phase of the Maya Program (2019-2022) seeks to consolidate the human rights based approach, and the results obtained in the previous phases. The focus will be on structural changes, in order to promote the construction of a multicultural, democratic and legal state. Given the serious situation of discrimination and exclusion of indigenous peoples and women, efforts will focus on increasing the participation of indigenous peoples and women in different decision-making spaces.</narrative>
  </description>
